    "color_palette": "Brand palette taken from the bottle: hot fuchsia #E6177F (main accent), deep magenta #B0105E, dark plum #2B1226 (deep backgrounds and header blocks), bottle black #0E0E10, bubblegum pink #FF8CC0 (accent text), pale blush pink #FBE3EE (light pills and soft surfaces) and white #FFFFFF for main texts. Each variation adds its own secondary support colors from the batch plan.",
