    "graphic_language": "Solid flat color blocks, rounded cards and pills with thin glowing fuchsia borders, white thin-line icons, clean high-contrast typography readable on a phone.",
    "text_typography": "Headlines in a very heavy geometric sans-serif (Montserrat ExtraBold / Black look), uppercase or sentence case as the format asks; secondary texts in a rounded bold sans-serif (Poppins SemiBold / Bold look). Native formats (story captions, chat bubbles, handwritten notes) keep their native type style.",
